 "about_text": "Serious Topics is a small artist-run gallery in Inglewood, California, founded by artists Kristin Calabrese and Joshua Aster. The space operates informally, showing and selling works on paper and other modestly scaled pieces through its flatfiles and inventory, viewable by appointment. Its program brings together a wide roster of contemporary artists working in graphite, ink, watercolor, and collage, emphasizing intimate, works-on-paper practices over large-scale production. The gallery periodically mounts solo exhibitions, including a planned show by Susanna Coffey. Visits are by appointment, reflecting its low-key, artist-driven approach to running a commercial exhibition space.",
